    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "FOR SALE IN ONE LOT:\r\n\r\n•\tAn existing 3 bedroom house of 93sqm – (see description below); and  \r\n•\tA site with planning permission for a new 3 bedroom house of 90sqm. \r\n\r\nPlanning Reference FW26A/0144E\r\n\r\n\r\nExisting house: \r\n\r\nAccommodation includes entrance hallway, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining area, sunroom and guest wc, while upstairs comprises of 3 bedrooms and a main bathroom. Outside the rear is west facing with a wooden shed, while the front is in lawn with off street parking. Ideally located within a short walking distance are 39 bus route, Hartstown Shopping Centre, primary and secondary schools and Clonsilla train station. All major road networks, numerous supermarkets and the Blanchardstown Shopping Centre are just a short drive away while Dublin Airport is easily accessible via the N3 and the M50."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall:\t4.70m x 1.80m\tWith a tiled floor\r\n\r\nLiving Room:\t4.50m x 3.01m\tWith a wooden floor and a feature open fireplace \r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area:\t4.95m x 3.40m \tOpen-plan area with a fitted kitchen and a tiled floor \r\n\r\nSunroom:\t4.35m x 3.08m \tWith a tiled floor and access to the rear garden \r\n\r\nGuest WC: \t1.45m x 0.72m \tWith wc, whb and a tiled floor \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: \t\t3.94m x 2.97m \t A double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and laminate wooden flooring \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: \t\t4.05m x 2.75m \tA double bedroom with built-in wardrobes and laminate wooden flooring\r\n\r\nBedroom 3: \t\t2.53m x 2.08m \t  A single bedroom with built-in wardrobes and laminate wooden flooring\r\n \t\r\nBathroom:   \t\t2.35m x 1.83m\tFully tiled with triton power shower, a bath, wc & whb  \r\n\r\nHeating:\t\tGas Fired Central Heating – boiler replaced 2024 \r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nNotice: Please note that we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these or indeed any items.  All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only. Whilst every effort is taken to ensure the accuracy of this information, Branagan Estates shall not be held liable for any inaccuracies or omissions. Interested parties must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all of the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, email, letter, report or hand out issued by or on behalf of Branagan Estates or the vendor. No person in the employment of Branagan Estates has any authority to make or give representation or warranty whatsoever in relation to this property."
      },
